        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr.Fat's Chopstick Challenge is a colorful arcade game starring a large cat named Mr.Fat! Help Mr.Fat learn to use chopsticks by scooping foods on his conveyor belts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy two game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARCADE MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to get as many foods out as possible, but be careful.... if you have more than 3 foods on the table, it's game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHOPSTICK CHALLENGE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See if you can collect all 50 foods in order!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by the very talented Mr.Maritime on Youtube!</p>",
